  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - HUFS Dorm\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHUFS Dorm\nHUFs Dorm\nGlobal Campus (Yongin City)\nHUFS Dorm Rate\nHUFS directly manages HUFS Dorm. Payment for HUFS-managed dormitories is done\nbefore the regular semester starts by cash to the Dorm office directly.\nRegular Semester (16 weeks) 1,300,000 KRW\nAddress\nHUFS  Dorm (Building, Room # )\nHankuk University of Foreign Studies\n81 Oedae-ro, Mohyeon-eup, Cheoin-gu, Yongin-si, Gyeonggi-do, South Korea\nHUFS DORM\nLocation\nCheck In\nWhen you check-in the dorm, you will get the key card which will let you into the dorm building and your room on the 1st floor of Building A.\nOn check in day, you will find out your room number.\nThe dormitory fee is the same as the amount on the application form.\nApplication: Download\nHealth Form: Download\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
